@omdp/dsh-connector README · `@omdp/dsh-archived-sessions` — archived-session manager (`v0.3.11`)：- List archived sessions with title / ID / workspace / disk usage / running state;
- **Release** (释放): move a session out of the archive set (no data deleted);
- **Delete** (删除): delete the session directory + **broadcast `api-session/removed`** + prune the archive id + release the workspace accounting slot (two-step confirm);
- **Tree delete**: deleting a main session also deletes its `parentSession` subtree (fixes upstream issue #2 — orphan subagents);
- **Orphan sweep**: scan and clean leftover subagent dirs whose parent session is already gone (same 4-step teardown as Delete since 0.3.10);
- Deletion safety: refuses to delete any path whose directory name is not a session dir (`session-<uuid>` or bare UUID); deletion is **dual-era** since 0.3.6 — it prefers `ctx.shell.resolve()` → `execute()` → `await result()` on DSH 0.1.7+, and falls back to `resolve()` → `run()` on ≤0.1.6, so one build deletes across the whole line. (0.3.5 only called `execute()` — which fixed 0.1.7 but silently broke rc.x, where `run()` is the only method; 0.3.4 had the mirror-image bug. Verified by unpacking e

@omdp/dsh-connector README · `@omdp/dsh-archived-sessions` — archived-session manager (`v0.3.11`)：- **DSH `0.2.1` support (v0.3.11)** — the `@deepseek-ai/dsh` peer gained the **second triple segment** `>=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.2.1-0 || >=0.2.1-rc.1 <0.2.2-0`; `cordis` gained `4.0.5`. **Zero code changes.** The `api-session/removed` chain this plugin relies on (the 0.3.10 fix) now runs through the new `dsh-api-remote-access` service, which short-circuits to ALLOW for the profile owner — and the desktop profile is the owner.

```jsonc
"dependencies": { "@omdp/dsh-archived-sessions": "^0.3.11" }
```

@omdp/dsh-connector README · Installing from npm (recommended)：All three plugins are published to **npm** automatically by GitHub Actions on every `v*` tag. This is the **preferred** install path — it avoids the git-`#path:` normalization, cross-resolution, and `allowBuilds` friction that GitHub installs cause (see the history in `docs/npm-publish.md`).

```jsonc
// ~/.dsh/profiles/<name>/package.json — you can use one or mix-and-match
"dependencies": {
  "@omdp/dsh-connector": "^0.3.10",
  "@omdp/dsh-key-fallback": "^3.3.3",

@omdp/dsh-connector README · `@omdp/dsh-connector` — MCP + Skills 管理器（`v0.3.10`）：- **支持 DSH `0.2.1`（v0.3.10）** —— `@deepseek-ai/dsh` peer 新增**第二段三元组区间**：`>=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.2.1-0 || >=0.2.1-rc.1 <0.2.2-0`（`schemastery` 同步追加 `3.18.5`，为 `0.2.1-rc.2` 的钉版）。**代码零改动。** 四层核查：全量 `@deepseek-ai/*` 逐文件 SHA256（`0.2.0-rc.2` → `0.2.1-rc.2`：288 → 305 个包，177 个有真实 `.js` 改动）、我们消费的 9 个包真实 ESM 导出面比对（移除项均未使用，在 `dsh-app-boot`）、调用到的 37 个符号逐个存在性复核、以及**真实 `0.2.1-rc.2` CLI 装配**（隔离 `DSH_HOME`，`--dump-config` 三个插件全部进树、零跳过）。

```jsonc
"dependencies": { "@omdp/dsh-connector": "^0.3.10" }
```

@omdp/dsh-connector README · `@omdp/dsh-key-fallback` — 多 key API 池 + 轮换（`v3.3.3`）：- **支持 DSH `0.2.1`（v3.3.3）** —— 四条 dsh peer 均新增**第二段三元组区间** `>=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.2.1-0 || >=0.2.1-rc.1 <0.2.2-0`；`cordis` 追加 `4.0.5`、`schemastery` 追加 `3.18.5`（均为 `0.2.1-rc.2` 的钉版）。**代码零改动** —— 本插件触及的整个面（`credentials.resolve` 包装、`ctx.llm` 事件、`settings`、`webServer`）在 `0.2.0-rc.2` 与 `0.2.1-rc.2` 之间逐字节一致，已由导出面比对 + 真机装配双重确认。

```jsonc
"dependencies": { "@omdp/dsh-key-fallback": "^3.3.3" }
```

@omdp/dsh-connector README · `@omdp/dsh-archived-sessions` — 归档会话管理（`v0.3.11`）：- **支持 DSH `0.2.1`（v0.3.11）** —— `@deepseek-ai/dsh` peer 新增**第二段三元组区间** `>=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.2.1-0 || >=0.2.1-rc.1 <0.2.2-0`；`cordis` 追加 `4.0.5`。**代码零改动。** 本插件依赖的 `api-session/removed` 链路（0.3.10 修复）在 0.2.1 上改由新的 `dsh-api-remote-access` 服务把关，而该服务对 profile owner 直接短路放行（桌面 profile 即 owner）。

```jsonc
"dependencies": { "@omdp/dsh-archived-sessions": "^0.3.11" }
```
